    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Smart External Links Manager detects external links in post content and adds:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>target=&#8221;_blank&#8221;</li>\n<li>rel=&#8221;noopener noreferrer&#8221;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Internal links, anchor links, mailto, and tel links are ignored.<br />\nThis plugin is intentionally lightweight and works out of the box without configuration.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to /wp-content/plugins/</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the Plugins menu</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Automatically adds secure attributes to external links in post content.",
    "description": "<p>Smart External Links Manager detects external links in post content and adds:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>target=&#8221;_blank&#8221;</li>\n<li>rel=&#8221;noopener noreferrer&#8221;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Internal links, anchor links, mailto, and tel links are ignored.<br />\nThis plugin is intentionally lightweight and works out of the box without configuration.</p>\n",
